Yoshiki.

00:15:22.388 --> 00:15:23.389
Bu.

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:25.758
Enggak bisa.

00:15:25.891 --> 00:15:26.892
Jangan disembunyikan.

00:15:37.303 --> 00:15:40.406
Mustahil, orang secantik
ini mana mungkin ibuku.

00:15:41.707 --> 00:15:42.708
Nggak bisa.

00:16:19.378 --> 00:16:20.379
