00:17:18.103 --> 00:17:19.238
Cantik banget.

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:26.412
Gila.

00:17:40.893 --> 00:17:41.894
Bu.

00:17:44.897 --> 00:17:47.366
Bu, tolonglah. Aku
sudah lama menyukainya.

00:17:48.934 --> 00:17:49.935
Tapi enggak bisa.

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:24.269
Suaramu terdengar jauh
